    {
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 80
      },
      "id": 21,
      "options": {
        "content": "## \ud83d\udd0d OOMKilled vs Running \u2014 Explained\n\n`kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` records the **last** reason a container was killed.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcc5 Timeline of Events\n1. \ud83d\udd34 Container exceeds memory limit \u2192 **OOMKilled**\n2. \ud83d\udd04 Kubernetes auto-restarts the container\n3. \ud83d\udfe2 Pod now shows **`Running`** in `kubectl get pods`\n4. \ud83d\udcca Metric still shows `reason=OOMKilled` (last death)\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 To Verify Manually\n```\nkubectl describe pod <pod-name> \\\n  -n <namespace>\n```\nLook for:\n```\nLast State:  Terminated\n  Reason:    OOMKilled\n  Exit Code: 137\n```\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd27 Fix\nIncrease `resources.limits.memory` in the container spec. The chart \u2192 shows how close current usage is to the limit.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "\ud83d\udcd6 Why Is The Pod Running But Shows OOMKilled?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PAE45454D0EDB9216"
      },
      "description": "Solid lines = actual memory working set for ALL container instances of OOMKilled pods (including the dead one that actually hit the limit). Dashed RED line = memory limit.\n\n\ud83d\udccc You will see TWO solid lines for the same pod:\n\u2022 Dead container \u2192 line climbs up and cuts off sharply when the kernel killed it (at the limit)\n\u2022 Live container \u2192 starts near 0 after restart and grows again\n\nBoth are captured because we filter by pod name directly \u2014 NOT by current OOMKilled state \u2014 so historical data from before the kill is fully visible.\n\nMemory request = 512 MiB | Memory limit = 2 GiB",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/^Limit:.*/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    10
                  ],
                  "fill": "dash"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.fillOpacity",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "fixedColor": "red",
                  "mode": "fixed"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 17,
        "x": 7,
        "y": 80
      },
      "id": 22,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PAE45454D0EDB9216"
          },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", pod=~\"$oomkilled_pods\", container!=\"POD\", container!=\"\"}",
          "interval": "1m",
          "legendFormat": "Usage: {{pod}} / {{container}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PAE45454D0EDB9216"
          },
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_resource_limits{resource=\"memory\", cluster=~\"$cluster\", exported_namespace=~\"$namespace\", exported_pod=~\"$oomkilled_pods\"}",
          "interval": "1m",
          "legendFormat": "Limit: {{exported_pod}} / {{container}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "timeFrom": null,
      "title": "Memory Usage vs Limit \u2014 OOMKilled Pods (All Container Instances)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
